<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png">
  <title>Join the waitlist | Maal</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Be first to get your Maal Score, the financial wellbeing score for every Australian.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,400..800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/retro-theme.css">
  <style>
    body { background: var(--bg); min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    main { flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .wl-inner { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 5rem 1.5rem; width: 100%; }
    .wl-kicker { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .18em; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .wl-h1 { font-size: clamp(2.2rem,6vw,3.25rem); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.03em; line-height: 1.05; }
    .wl-sub { margin-top: 1.25rem; font-size: 15px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.65; }
    .wl-success { margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(18,181,166,.3); background: rgba(18,181,166,.05); }
    .wl-success-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
    .wl-success-body { font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-top: .25rem; }
    .wl-form { margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; }
    @media (min-width: 500px) { .wl-form { flex-direction: row; } }
    .wl-input { flex: 1; height: 44px; padding: 0 .875rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--surface); font-size: 14px; font-family: var(--font-body); color: var(--fg); outline: none; box-sizing: border-box; transition: border-color .15s; }
    .wl-input:focus { border-color: var(--fg); }
    .wl-input::placeholder { color: var(--fg-muted); }
    .wl-submit { height: 44px; padding: 0 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; background: var(--fg); color: #fff; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; border: none; cursor: pointer; font-family: var(--font-body); transition: opacity .15s; white-space: nowrap; }
    .wl-submit:hover { opacity: .88; }
    .wl-submit:disabled { opacity: .5; cursor: default; }
    .wl-alert { margin-top: .75rem; font-size: 12px; color: #dc2626; }
    .wl-trust { margin-top: .875rem; font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-muted); }
    .wl-proof { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
    @media (min-width: 500px) { .wl-proof { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }
    .wl-proof-big { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; }
    .wl-proof-small { margin-top: .2rem; font-size: 11px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.4; }
    .wl-shape { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 2.5rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .wl-shape-title { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }
    .wl-shape-list { margin-top: 1rem; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .75rem; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .wl-shape-item { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: .625rem; font-size: 13px; color: var(--fg-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
    .wl-shape-dot { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--mint); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: .45rem; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main>
    <div class="wl-inner">
      <p class="wl-kicker">Early access</p>
      <h1 class="wl-h1">Be first to get your Maal Score.</h1>
      <p class="wl-sub">We're opening access in waves. Join the list and we'll email your invite, plus your first Maal Score, the moment your wave goes live.</p>

      <div id="wl-success" class="wl-success" style="display:none">
        <p class="wl-success-title">You're on the list.</p>
        <p class="wl-success-body">We'll email you the moment your invite is ready.</p>
      </div>

      <form id="wl-form" class="wl-form">
        <input id="wl-email" class="wl-input" type="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email">
        <button id="wl-btn" class="wl-submit" type="submit">Join waitlist</button>
      </form>
      <p id="wl-error" class="wl-alert" style="display:none"></p>
      <p class="wl-trust">No spam. No card required. Maal provides education and general information only.</p>

      <div class="wl-proof">
        <div>
          <p class="wl-proof-big">3 scores</p>
          <p class="wl-proof-small">Credit, debt &amp; financial wellbeing</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="wl-proof-big">100+ institutions</p>
          <p class="wl-proof-small">Connected via Basiq open banking</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="wl-proof-big">Built for AU</p>
          <p class="wl-proof-small">Super, HECS &amp; ATO native</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="wl-proof-big">Read-only</p>
          <p class="wl-proof-small">Maal can never move your money</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="wl-shape">
        <p class="wl-shape-title">What early users will help shape</p>
        <ul class="wl-shape-list">
          <li class="wl-shape-item"><span class="wl-shape-dot"></span>How the Maal Score is explained, pillar by pillar</li>
          <li class="wl-shape-item"><span class="wl-shape-dot"></span>Which score drivers matter most to everyday Australians</li>
          <li class="wl-shape-item"><span class="wl-shape-dot"></span>The questions Ask Maal should handle best around super, HECS and debt</li>
          <li class="wl-shape-item"><span class="wl-shape-dot"></span>What Radar should flag as a meaningful change worth an alert</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- analyticsSnippet %>

  <script>
  (function() {
    var form = document.getElementById('wl-form');
    var btn = document.getElementById('wl-btn');
    var successEl = document.getElementById('wl-success');
    var errorEl = document.getElementById('wl-error');
    form.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      var email = document.getElementById('wl-email').value.trim();
      if (!email) return;
      btn.disabled = true;
      btn.textContent = 'Joining\u2026';
      errorEl.style.display = 'none';
      fetch('/api/waitlist', {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
        body: JSON.stringify({ email: email })
      }).then(function(r) { return r.json(); }).then(function(data) {
        if (data.ok) {
          form.style.display = 'none';
          successEl.style.display = 'block';
        } else {
          errorEl.textContent = data.error || 'Something went wrong.';
          errorEl.style.display = 'block';
          btn.disabled = false;
          btn.textContent = 'Join waitlist';
        }
      }).catch(function() {
        errorEl.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again.';
        errorEl.style.display = 'block';
        btn.disabled = false;
        btn.textContent = 'Join waitlist';
      });
    });
  })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>